384 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 242 0 R
/E (    GrowBrain is an Android-based assistive cognitive rehabilitation game designed for students with Mild Cognitive Impairments \(MCI\). It focuses on improving four core cognitive skills: Memory, Attention, Logic, and Verbal Skills. The system is intended to support SPED teachers and school administrators while providing students with an engaging, structured, and accessible learning experience. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
