391 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 243 0 R
/E (GrowBrain is designed as an assistive cognitive rehabilitation tool for students with Mild Cognitive Impairments \(MCI\). The system focuses on improving four core cognitive domains: Memory, Attention, Logic, and Verbal Skills through game-based activities. It is intended to support SPED teachers and school administrators in monitoring student progress and adjusting learning activities.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
