/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 243 0 R
/E (GrowBrain does not provide medical diagnosis, psychological assessment, or clinical treatment. The system does not cover physical, emotional, or behavioral therapy activities. GrowBrain is designed exclusively for Android devices and requires teacher supervision during student use.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
